                    briefing_text_r4:       `Present the case to the CFO and the works-council representative. Show the design <strong>holds +3%</strong>, closes equity to an acceptable ratio, narrows the specialist gap enough to stem attrition, and ties management pay to results — without overspending or breaking fairness. Commit to a <strong>four-metric scorecard</strong> (pay-equity ratio, projected retention, budget adherence, perceived fairness) and state what you deliberately deferred this cycle and how you will phase it next year. The facilitator will probe whether the mix actually <em>motivates</em> or merely redistributes.`,

